{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Clean up and relax</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spilled! is a short game in which there are no wrong ways to play.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can finish it in about an hour. Unwind and take as long as you want. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240080/extras/GrassBiome25Clean-V2.gif?t=1744461543\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Recycle  oil and upgrade your boat\u00a0 </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare your boat for the next area!<strong><br><br> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240080/extras/RecycleANDUpgrade.gif?t=1744461543\" /></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore new areas with bigger oil spills and new types of waste </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move through different biomes as you push plastic to the recycling center, extinguish fires, and more.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240080/extras/BiomeShowcase.png?t=1744461543\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Find and rescue cute animals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 16 animals to be found throughout the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240080/extras/AnimalSaving.gif?t=1744461543\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Around 1 hour of playtime. Come back to relax at anytime using the level selector.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clean up, recycle, earn coins and upgrade your boat to tackle the next area.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 areas to move through, each bigger in size, with bigger oil spills and different kinds of waste.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move through different biomes throughout the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and save 16 different animals throughout the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udcbb About the developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Hey! My name is Lente. I started working on Spilled! At the end of 2022. It is my first commercial release.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>I paused school and bought my own small boat to live on. Which lowered my cost of living and allowed me to fully focus  on Spilled! for a while.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Once my savings ran out, I ran a succesful Kickstarter which has kept me afloat all the way up until release! I am so happy I have been able to follow my dreams. I hope you like Spilled!</i><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240080/extras/Personal_Intro.png?t=1744461543\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fully Cleaned the first area!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2240080/0b2e994d2318fc2be355013646b7b7560431ee1d.jpg"},{"name":"Fully Cleaned the second area!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2240080/74a78333c5f8c4359fc25eac81e77ce791ce0774.jpg"},{"name":"Fully Cleaned the third area!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2240080/587029c41afe7a59e86bf94f96ff8839571be98f.jpg"},{"name":"Fully cleaned the fourth area!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2240080/1e482baf541f11d86c7b1e96594a9997fcb482da.jpg"},{"name":"Fully cleaned the fifth area!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2240080/3095c1dc8490f403cddbbb14e7ece5fdfae81cc0.jpg"},{"name":"Fully cleaned the sixth area!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2240080/bf052ffec81df7bf696def420b451196d96af906.jpg"},{"name":"Fully Cleaned the seventh area!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2240080/e6d5e2fef5b1113c528fd473fc194d00bd3500d0.jpg"},{"name":"Fully Cleaned the eighth area!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2240080/77287f6c855bb706a6beea1cb3d13f421d4cc679.jpg"},{"name":"Defeated the end boss!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2240080/565d8a4da46f3443c2d5ad3eec8eab4676e6f328.jpg"},{"name":"Collected all animals!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2240080/01ae44135fa1fb30557b38b67c3037d964c84db9.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2240080?t=1744461543","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2240080?t=1744461543","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240080/644f9143d83cc37f500943ef759feda213a8a3c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744461543","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240080/644f9143d83cc37f500943ef759feda213a8a3c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744461543","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2646600,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Whale and dolphin conservation x Spilled!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240080/extras/Spilled!_Graphic_WDC_V2.png?t=1744461543\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Clean up and relax</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spilled! is a short game in which there are no wrong ways to play.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can finish it in about an hour. Unwind and take as long as you want. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240080/extras/GrassBiome25Clean-V2.gif?t=1744461543\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Recycle  oil and upgrade your boat\u00a0 </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare your boat for the next area!<strong><br><br> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240080/extras/RecycleANDUpgrade.gif?t=1744461543\" /></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore new areas with bigger oil spills and new types of waste </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move through different biomes as you push plastic to the recycling center, extinguish fires, and more.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240080/extras/BiomeShowcase.png?t=1744461543\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Find and rescue cute animals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 16 animals to be found throughout the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240080/extras/AnimalSaving.gif?t=1744461543\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Around 1 hour of playtime. Come back to relax at anytime using the level selector.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clean up, recycle, earn coins and upgrade your boat to tackle the next area.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 areas to move through, each bigger in size, with bigger oil spills and different kinds of waste.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move through different biomes throughout the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and save 16 different animals throughout the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udcbb About the developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Hey! My name is Lente. I started working on Spilled! At the end of 2022. It is my first commercial release.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>I paused school and bought my own small boat to live on. Which lowered my cost of living and allowed me to fully focus  on Spilled! for a while.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Once my savings ran out, I ran a succesful Kickstarter which has kept me afloat all the way up until release! I am so happy I have been able to follow my dreams. I hope you like Spilled!</i><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240080/extras/Personal_Intro.png?t=1744461543\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","developers":["Lente"],"dlc":[3503730],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240080/header.jpg?t=1744461543","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> High Sierra 10.13+ (Intel editor) Big Sur 11.0 (Apple silicon Editor)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> sure</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul